cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this project in your research, please cite it and the key datasets and models it depends on.
title: Moodsic
type: software
abstract: >-
  Moodsic is a proof-of-concept pipeline that fuses VEATIC video affect predictions
  with DEAM music metadata to recommend emotion-aligned tracks. It combines a CLIP-based
  scene expert, an EmoNet face expert, fusion logic, and clustering-based playlist retrieval.
